---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ContentPage from '../../components/ContentPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Contact"
  description="Contact SummaryIn with corrections, feedback, profession requests, privacy questions, or partnership inquiries."
  yearInTitle={false}
>
  <ContentPage
    eyebrow="Contact"
    title="Tell us what would make SummaryIn more useful"
    lead="Send a correction, request a profession, ask a privacy question, or share a partnership idea."
  >
    <div class="contact-card">
      <strong>Email SummaryIn</strong>
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>
    </div>

    <h2>What to include</h2>
    <p>A short, specific message is easiest to act on. Helpful details include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>the URL of the page you are writing about;</li>
      <li>the sentence, example, or feature that needs attention;</li>
      <li>your suggested correction and, when relevant, a reliable source;</li>
      <li>the profession or career situation you would like us to cover.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Corrections</h2>
    <p>
      If an example uses the wrong credential, outdated terminology, or an unrealistic metric, please
      tell us. We review substantive corrections and update pages when a change improves accuracy.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy requests</h2>
    <p>
      Use the subject line “Privacy request” and explain what you need. The generator runs in your
      browser, so SummaryIn does not have a stored copy of the resume details you enter there. See the
      <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for more information.
    </p>

    <h2>Partnerships</h2>
    <p>
      Partnership messages should identify the company, the proposed placement, and whether payment or
      commission is involved. We do not accept paid links disguised as editorial recommendations.
    </p>
  </ContentPage>
</Base>
